  "description": "A .NET library that exports a slice of a SQL Server database into a single SQLite file and lets you import it back into SQL Server. Not a backup: you choose the tables, columns, and rows that come out, rewrite values in the file with plain SQL, then load it into a dev or test database or send it to someone who has no access to the source. Nothing to install on the server, no telemetry.",
